stateDiagram-v2
  %% Source: ScriptService (ReviewCoreAsync, DeactivateAsync, ReactivateAsync), ReviewService.DiscardPairAsync,
  %% trg_review_majority and trg_script_validated_domain in docs/codeswitchlabel.sql.
  %% A review round starts every time the pair enters pending_validation. One accepted/edited review per round:
  %% the DB trigger needs a review stamped after the last reset, and the service guard counts the same way.
  [*] --> pending_validation: import / contribute / admin create
  pending_validation --> validated: accepted or edited by a domain-qualified reviewer (review of this round)
  pending_validation --> rejected: rejected with reason
  validated --> pending_validation: majority rejects a recording for a content reason (new round)
  pending_validation --> deactivated: deactivate (no recordings) or discard-pair
  validated --> deactivated: deactivate (no recordings) or discard-pair
  rejected --> deactivated: discard-pair (a sibling recording still pending review)
  rejected --> pending_validation: reactivate (new round)
  deactivated --> pending_validation: reactivate (new round)
